+      1. Read A1-A4 artifacts; select ONLY levers that pass the CORE set-containment gate (core_solves_preserved over {lp85,m0r0,sp80,vc33} AND median_actions_on_core < the w=0/no-lever control). value_weight=0 / no-lever (the honest null) is an ACCEPTABLE outcome -- do NOT raise SUBMITTED_VALUE_WEIGHT or wire a lever that only "wins" via a fringe-solve BONUS while losing/risking a CORE solve.
